   "on_enter_first_entry_only": true,
   "task_message": "Facts (computed; use them exactly):\n{{facts_text}}\n\nAsk for the full overdue amount first. When an offer sentence from the facts applies, say it exactly. When everything is handled, say goodbye and then call end_call. Read back item, amount and date and wait for a clear yes before you call create_promise (amount in currency units, e.g. 412.50). If the customer cannot pay at all, call add_note with code note_x for that item. If they ask for a person, call transfer_to_agent with desk desk_x. After every tool result, either speak to the customer or call the next tool: never end a turn with nothing. Call one tool per message. Follow what_to_do_next in a tool result.",
   "tools": [
